From cdf1713c069844979fdd0d3b2929fb5055e24b0b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henry Essinghigh <henry@essinghigh.dev>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:38:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] MIPS: Octeon: add CN70XX AGL (RGMII management port) support

On CN70XX the RGMII management port is the AGL block, exposed as
interface 4 / IPD+PKO port 24. OpenWrt's executive left it as a TODO.
Port the AGL probe/enable/link code from the OCTEON SDK 5.1 executive,
add the CN70XX AGL_PRTX_CTL layout, map interface 4 to port 24, and teach
the staging octeon-ethernet driver to use the AGL registers for that port.

Signed-off-by: Henry Essinghigh <henry@essinghigh.dev>
